world Hard
title 挑战世界：第二公里
intro 六个世界的技巧在这里合流。每关都是一道组合题，提示会很少——是时候把 And/Or/Not/Exists/Iff 当作真正的工具来用了。
using: all
level 1
name 分配律正向
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), And a (Or b c) -> Or (And a b) (And a c)
hint: cases h 拆出 ha : a 与 hbc : Or b c，再 cases hbc 分 b/c 两路
hint: 每路 apply Or.inl/Or.inr 后 apply And.intro 组装（ha 全程复用）
variant: 换组装顺序——And a (Or b c) -> Or b (Or a c)（先拆再换路）
solution:
intro a b c
intro h
cases h as ha hbc
cases hbc as hb hc
apply Or.inl
apply And.intro
exact ha
exact hb
apply Or.inr
apply And.intro
exact ha
exact hc
---
level 2
name 析取分配律
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), Or a (And b c) -> And (Or a b) (Or a c)
hint: 前提 Or 分两路：a 路（Or.inl 两次）与 And b c 路（再 cases）
hint: 每路 apply And.intro 拆目标为两个析取，分别选择方向
variant: 双向 Iff 版——Iff (Or a (And b c)) (And (Or a b) (Or a c))
solution:
intro a b c
intro h
cases h as ha hbc
apply And.intro
apply Or.inl
exact ha
apply Or.inl
exact ha
cases hbc as hb hc
apply And.intro
apply Or.inr
exact hb
apply Or.inr
exact hc
---
level 3
name curry 消去
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), (a -> b -> c) -> And a b -> c
hint: 拆开 And a b 拿到 ha、hb 后，h ha hb 一步出 c
variant: 反向——(And a b -> c) -> a -> b -> c（curry 引入）
solution:
intro a b c
intro h
intro hab
cases hab as ha hb
exact h ha hb
---
level 4
name Or 的替换
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), (a -> b) -> Or a c -> Or b c
hint: cases hoc 分两路：a 路用 h 换型后 Or.inl，c 路 Or.inr 原样
variant: 换右分量——(c -> d) -> Or a c -> Or a d
solution:
intro a b c
intro h
intro hoc
cases hoc as ha hc
apply Or.inl
exact h ha
apply Or.inr
exact hc
---
level 5
name 积的映射
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), forall (d : Prop), (a -> b) -> (c -> d) -> And a c -> And b d
hint: 拆开 And a c 拿 ha、hc；apply And.intro 后各用对应的函数
variant: 换成 Or——(a -> b) -> (c -> d) -> Or a c -> Or b d（四种组合要分四路？想想）
solution:
intro a b c d
intro h1
intro h2
intro hac
cases hac as ha hc
apply And.intro
exact h1 ha
exact h2 hc
---
level 6
name 全量分配律
goal: forall (p : Prop), forall (q : Prop), forall (r : Prop), Iff (And p (Or q r)) (Or (And p q) (And p r))
hint: 方向一（And -> Or）：cases 两层拆出 p/q/r，两路组装
hint: 方向二（Or -> And）：cases h 分两路，每路 p 用 And.left 投影、析取用 And.right + 方向
hint: 整题先 apply Iff.intro 把目标拆成两个方向，再分别处理
variant: 大满贯——把 Iff 换成双向函数：(And p (Or q r) -> Or (And p q) (And p r)) -> (Or (And p q) (And p r) -> And p (Or q r)) -> True（想想为什么）
solution:
intro p q r
apply Iff.intro
intro h
cases h as hp hqr
cases hqr as hq hr
apply Or.inl
apply And.intro
exact hp
exact hq
apply Or.inr
apply And.intro
exact hp
exact hr
intro h
cases h as h1 h2
apply And.intro
exact (@And.left p q h1)
apply Or.inl
exact (@And.right p q h1)
apply And.intro
exact (@And.left p r h2)
apply Or.inr
exact (@And.right p r h2)
